{{en-noun|head=[[high]] [[fidelity]]|-}} (abbreviated as ''[[hi-fi]]'' or ''[[HiFi]]'')

# An [[electronic]] [[system]] that [[reproduce]]s a given [[sound]] or [[image]] with relatively high [[accuracy]].
#* {{quote-journal|date=13 November 1954|title=The low-down on high fidelity |newspaper=Billboard|page=127|passage='''High Fidelity''' is an attempt to minimize the effect of the electro-mechanical means necessary to the reproduction of music.}}
